{"author":{"id":"8022379585b4ab99ca8775db3eb67d33fcb256817114c28e51ccc1e9f55cdec4"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1789952945,"nonce":"fvsjYGHlzMWZ1lh/1eRpLkY+KLs=","message":"Landed: every closure target (lambda, closure-value adapter, method-ref\nthunk, mapped-static thunk, inner function) gets a box-shaped entry\n`(env, box..) -\u003e box` and, when its declared types are not already 64-bit\nslots, a slot-shaped one `(env, i64..) -\u003e i64`; `__vtable_init__` (now\ngenerated after `__init__`, so a static initializer's lambda is included)\nregisters them by the record's code pointer through\n`haxe_closure_register_entries`. A Dynamic call site boxes every argument\nand calls `haxe_closure_dynamic_view(closure)`; the runtime array helpers\nand ereg map call `closure_slot_code(fn_ptr)`. The per-slot conversion\nkind comes from the closure's Haxe function type when known (a `Dynamic`\nparameter is passed its box; an erased `T` its payload bits), else from\nthe MIR type with pointer-to-void read as Dynamic.\n\nConsumers of a Dynamic call's result had assumed it raw; the result\nregister is recorded in `boxed_value_regs` and a KNOWN box is unboxed at a\nreturn into a concrete type, at a local or cross-module call formal\n(`haxe_dynamic_to_slot` for an erased `T`, the typed unbox otherwise), and\nin `normalize_dynamic_args_for_erased_formals` -- where the conservative\n`haxe_unbox_scalar_or_addr` stays for registers that may be raw.\n\nThe mapped-static thunk (`Reflect.compare` as a value) took no env while\nevery indirect call passes one; it now has the env parameter every closure\ntarget has. A pushed function literal now types an untyped `var arr = []`\n(Issue3792), and a call through a function-typed parameter gives the\narguments' types to the unannotated ones (`callTyped(cmp:Int-\u003eInt-\u003eInt, x, y)`).\n\nProbes: S3, D1, M1 (all match `haxe --run`), L1, L2, RC1, FV2.\nFixture: FunctionValues.hx (dynamic, dynamic untyped formal, dynamic args\nto typed formal, dynamic string, dynamic float, Float map).","files":null}]}